## Summary of Changes

| Aspect | Before | After |
|--------|--------|-------|
| **Download on holiday** | ❌ Downloads stale data | ✅ Skips gracefully |
| **File naming** | By download date | By actual NAV date |
| **1-day diff** | Often 0 (same NAV date) | Always compares different trading days |
| **Metadata** | Only download_date | Both download_date + actual_nav_date |
| **Holiday handling** | Manual/hardcoded | NSE_HOLIDAYS_2026 dict + weekends |

Now when Sep 4 is a holiday:
- No download happens ✅
- Previous file (Sep 2 NAV) stays valid ✅
- 1-day diff on Sep 5 compares Sep 3 vs Sep 2 correctly ✅

